<title>JAPAN: Taisei to buy back up to Y25 bln worth of shares.</title>
<headline>Taisei to buy back up to Y25 bln worth of shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taisei Corp said on Friday that it would buy back up to 25 billion yen worth, or 55 million, of its shares.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the share repurchase plan would have to be approved at the company's annual shareholders' meeting in late June.</p>
</text>
